verts commit a7a2a8d5734800eebfe798e54638de6df76ba9f8.\n", "files": ["python/mozbuild/mozbuild/repackaging/deb.py"], "git_node": "8acedb7785fce2ecf1b6d29fbe29d9c79ec9283c", "git_parents": ["c0a000c72220b9ec6dc4d092bab8adacc797435a"], "node": "957b880e06947e64579491c0508f6b8b7475f7d1", "parents": ["daf94c66c786de7bd05cf112f534e3230aa69857"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790304213, "git_changesets": ["8acedb7785fce2ecf1b6d29fbe29d9c79ec9283c"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "689": {"changesets": [{"author": "Dianna Smith \u003cdsmith@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Reapply \"Bug 2074917 - Enable missing depends epoch for all thunderbird l10n packages.\" a=dsmith\n\nThis reverts commit 8acedb7785fce2ecf1b6d29fbe29d9c79ec9283c.\n", "files": ["python/mozbuild/mozbuild/repackaging/deb.py"], "git_node": "cf433a5a5dfa657b929beb02950473b8fc5b0e63", "git_parents": ["8acedb7785fce2ecf1b6d29fbe29d9c79ec9283c"], "node": "3e4d7e0ee6d975515b40a40e8c2b4608fc8899c4", "parents": ["957b880e06947e64579491c0508f6b8b7475f7d1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dianna Smith \u003cdsmith@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2067697 - Fix fragility of toggling between vertical and horizontal tabs \" for causing bustage a=backout\n\nThis reverts commit df1021737bbb1b99e247ac012406a2c2acf5c7b4.\n", "files": ["browser/components/sessionstore/SessionStore.sys.mjs", "browser/components/sidebar/tests/browser/browser.toml", "browser/components/sidebar/tests/browser/browser_vertical_tabs_restore_last_window.js"], "git_node": "c63a9674bf63a60f026ec91e7593c0cd5d5b6f11", "git_parents": ["cf433a5a5dfa657b929beb02950473b8fc5b0e63"], "node": "c1f718c71d8fb80599dde2e618c8e1eb72f9d8cc", "parents": ["3e4d7e0ee6d975515b40a40e8c2b4608fc8899c4"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790304794, "git_changesets": ["cf433a5a5dfa657b929beb02950473b8fc5b0e63", "c63a9674bf63a60f026ec91e7593c0cd5d5b6f11"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "690": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nicolas Silva \u003cnsilva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2071426 - Fix nine-patch corner radius when the clip's space is flipped.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nget_prim_render_strategy maps the rounded rect clip's corner radius into the\nprimitive's space. Two spaces can share a coordinate system while being flipped\nwith respect to one another (for example with transform: rotate(180deg)), in\nwhich case the mapped vector has negative components.\n\nprepare_nine_patch builds the corner rects as min..min+radius and\nmax-radius..max, so a negative radius places the four masked corner segments\noutside of the nine-patch rect. The unmasked center segment then covers the\nrounded corners, which is why they were rendered sharp.\n\nThe tiled path has the same constraint and already takes the absolute value of\nits mapped radii.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325784\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326075\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/quad.rs", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/clip/flipped-rounded-rect-ref.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/clip/flipped-rounded-rect.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/clip/reftest.list"], "git_node": "687fc2ce6728154984db288782a57771cde158d2", "git_parents": ["c63a9674bf63a60f026ec91e7593c0cd5d5b6f11"], "node": "9e91a2f870ef848d879c1a85f634ab080be4b407", "parents": ["c1f718c71d8fb80599dde2e618c8e1eb72f9d8cc"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790348825, "git_changesets": ["687fc2ce6728154984db288782a57771cde158d2"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "691": {"changesets": [{"author": "Iain Ireland \u003ciireland@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074161: Fix constant folding for MUrsh  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327988\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328244\n", "files": ["js/src/jit/MIR.cpp"], "git_node": "e211f3aa725310582e9317d0c04aabdf68c27b5d", "git_parents": ["687fc2ce6728154984db288782a57771cde158d2"], "node": "026f422a51b4266b6e14efefdf21c38922e3e602", "parents": ["9e91a2f870ef848d879c1a85f634ab080be4b407"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790348847, "git_changesets": ["e211f3aa725310582e9317d0c04aabdf68c27b5d"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "692": {"changesets": [{"author": "Andrew McCreight \u003ccontinuation@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073703, part 1 - Make the ContentProcessManager remote frame registration functions more resilient.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nMake all of the callers of RegisterRemoteFrame check the return value. If this\nfailed, then if we keep going things will probably be in a weird state.\n\nChange UnregisterRemoteFrame to take a BrowserParent, and confirm that the\nvalue in mBrowserParentMap is what we expect. This will prevent the map\nbeing in a bad state from removing too many keep alives.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327515\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328847\n", "files": ["dom/ipc/BrowserBridgeParent.cpp", "dom/ipc/BrowserParent.cpp", "dom/ipc/ContentParent.cpp", "dom/ipc/ContentProcessManager.cpp", "dom/ipc/ContentProcessManager.h"], "git_node": "7b4863f167cd78c5425717e8634e969f0cf469f4", "git_parents": ["e211f3aa725310582e9317d0c04aabdf68c27b5d"], "node": "211649a61b9d82ab9cf2f42fca594d853032967b", "parents": ["026f422a51b4266b6e14efefdf21c38922e3e602"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrew McCreight \u003ccontinuation@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073703, part 2 - Unregister the new remote frame if BindPBrowserEndpoint fails.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nBe defensive and unregister if the bind call fails.\n\nThe call to Bind, which ends up as UntypedManagedEndpoint::BindCommon, shouldn't fail:\n\n* aActor was just created, so it won't be null.\n\n* IsForProtocol was already checked by ParamTraits\u003cManagedEndpoint\u003cPFooSide\u003e\u003e::Read.\n\n* IsValidForManager is checked at the top of RecvConstructPopupBrowser.\n\n* We're in a Recv method and haven't returned to the event loop so CanSend() and\n  GetIPCChannel() should still be true.\n\n* This endpoint was sent over IPC so mTopLevel should be set.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327516\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328848\n", "files": ["dom/ipc/ContentParent.cpp"], "git_node": "8184ed6e7e4bff74e7552a57a7ed82e3ea6cf034", "git_parents": ["7b4863f167cd78c5425717e8634e969f0cf469f4"], "node": "89523f482e11101539f08e4f114f6b6131080fe4", "parents": ["211649a61b9d82ab9cf2f42fca594d853032967b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790349062, "git_changesets": ["7b4863f167cd78c5425717e8634e969f0cf469f4", "8184ed6e7e4bff74e7552a57a7ed82e3ea6cf034"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "693": {"changesets": [{"author": "Kelly Cochrane \u003ckcochrane@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067697 - Fix fragility of toggling between vertical and horizontal tabs  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328223\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328703\n", "files": ["browser/components/sessionstore/SessionStore.sys.mjs", "browser/components/sidebar/tests/browser/browser.toml", "browser/components/sidebar/tests/browser/browser_vertical_tabs_restore_last_window.js"], "git_node": "9728e6e354f34bf6a91f03a9081d0ca308e7bc55", "git_parents": ["8184ed6e7e4bff74e7552a57a7ed82e3ea6cf034"], "node": "7645ddf6d63f798e066090ed2df79877fba556f2", "parents": ["89523f482e11101539f08e4f114f6b6131080fe4"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790350917, "git_changesets": ["9728e6e354f34bf6a91f03a9081d0ca308e7bc55"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "694": {"changesets": [{"author": "John M. Schanck \u003cjschanck@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067571 - add a process type restriction for extension-specific RP ID claims. a=dsmith\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326343\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328916\n", "files": ["dom/webauthn/WebAuthnUtil.cpp", "toolkit/components/extensions/test/mochitest/test_ext_webauthn.html"], "git_node": "02681c38ded866003f6ff1c719b035bc6101d424", "git_parents": ["9728e6e354f34bf6a91f03a9081d0ca308e7bc55"], "node": "5eabce7f80a18a33edcc0f91d62abbcb1f66e683", "parents": ["7645ddf6d63f798e066090ed2df79877fba556f2"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Iain Ireland \u003ciireland@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073267: Add GuardSpecificObject for global lexical SetGName a=dsmith\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328386\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328730\n", "files": ["js/src/jit-test/tests/environments/bug2073267.js", "js/src/jit/CacheIR.cpp"], "git_node": "3e80ce5caac5ee993e90533bd6e8de7a64db7854", "git_parents": ["02681c38ded866003f6ff1c719b035bc6101d424"], "node": "f34bdf1a4a09d43d55a05464c7c78a09519cc655", "parents": ["5eabce7f80a18a33edcc0f91d62abbcb1f66e683"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Iain Ireland \u003ciireland@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074164: Resolve primitive object constructors in WarpOracle a=dsmith\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328316\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328626\n", "files": ["js/src/jit/WarpOracle.cpp", "js/src/vm/JSObject.cpp"], "git_node": "f02164ce43425dda8b558c9fe740f1d3063de240", "git_parents": ["3e80ce5caac5ee993e90533bd6e8de7a64db7854"], "node": "50efddaacbd77ae0062a16368062691d3e6349be", "parents": ["f34bdf1a4a09d43d55a05464c7c78a09519cc655"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074625 - Avoid updating properties with retargeted animation. a=dsmith\n\nThis is the low risk fix. I think we need to figure out whether we even\nwant to use that retargeted effect at all? But that seems like a\nfollow-up bug.\n\nRule tree changes are just assertions that catch this earlier.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328567\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328798\n", "files": ["layout/style/nsAnimationManager.cpp", "servo/components/style/rule_tree/core.rs", "testing/web-platform/tests/web-animations/crashtests/keyframe-effect-cross-doc-target.html"], "git_node": "cf9f8b346ae66198b6a305e12b7668b26cac5d95", "git_parents": ["f02164ce43425dda8b558c9fe740f1d3063de240"], "node": "afa5d928a8b11a9910ffd306960c33dd04bc20a4", "parents": ["50efddaacbd77ae0062a16368062691d3e6349be"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790351081, "git_changesets": ["02681c38ded866003f6ff1c719b035bc6101d424", "3e80ce5caac5ee993e90533bd6e8de7a64db7854", "f02164ce43425dda8b558c9fe740f1d3063de240", "cf9f8b346ae66198b6a305e12b7668b26cac5d95"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "695": {"changesets": [{"author": "Dianna Smith \u003cdsmith@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2067571 - add a process type restriction for extension-specific RP ID claims.\" for causing failures a=backout\n\nThis reverts commit 02681c38ded866003f6ff1c719b035bc6101d424.\n", "files": ["dom/webauthn/WebAuthnUtil.cpp", "toolkit/components/extensions/test/mochitest/test_ext_webauthn.html"], "git_node": "a9646dbc665fc6b60e07ce55a2603482dc6af8d4", "git_parents": ["cf9f8b346ae66198b6a305e12b7668b26cac5d95"], "node": "23ff586ad342c4b4b078c024964b28f156c3db73", "parents": ["afa5d928a8b11a9910ffd306960c33dd04bc20a4"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790352305, "git_changesets": ["a9646dbc665fc6b60e07ce55a2603482dc6af8d4"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "696": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jari Jalkanen \u003cjjalkanen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058651: Stop WritableFileStreams from following moved paths.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318103\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329253\n", "files": ["dom/fs/parent/FileSystemHashSource.cpp", "dom/fs/parent/datamodel/FileSystemDatabaseManagerVersion002.cpp"], "git_node": "1eef5527d250833f6d103b6f8a31a56c8a36d76b", "git_parents": ["a9646dbc665fc6b60e07ce55a2603482dc6af8d4"], "node": "95498d5fa09ea85300e2d2f81ef7f27453d1091c", "parents": ["23ff586ad342c4b4b078c024964b28f156c3db73"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790359195, "git_changesets": ["1eef5527d250833f6d103b6f8a31a56c8a36d76b"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "697": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr153 repo-update HSTS HPKP -  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329306\n", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc"], "git_node": "1f4fbe9cff627b1e6fc498b73fef83e606fecb1c", "git_parents": ["1eef5527d250833f6d103b6f8a31a56c8a36d76b"], "node": "b8c732299cd65d8dc3695147b591dc8abb997b06", "parents": ["95498d5fa09ea85300e2d2f81ef7f27453d1091c"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790368435, "git_changesets": ["1f4fbe9cff627b1e6fc498b73fef83e606fecb1c"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "698": {"changesets": [{"author": "Julien Cristau \u003cjcristau@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075231 - tell pip not to try and be smart when installing funsize deps  a=diannaS\n\nrequirements.txt already includes the necessary dependencies, no need to\nresolve them again and risk breakage at install time.\n\ngithub3-py depends on pyjwt[crypto], and the pip in debian 12 (23.0.1)\ndoesn't consider the pinned pyjwt==2.14.0 as satisfying that dependency,\nso it picked the latest pyjwt from PyPI instead, which broke when 2.15.0\nwas released as it's not pinned.\n\nRun pip check after the install as an extra safety.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328838\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329239\n", "files": ["taskcluster/docker/funsize-update-generator/Dockerfile"], "git_node": "0bfb786fafd5393bef567e55f61c77340cd54481", "git_parents": ["1f4fbe9cff627b1e6fc498b73fef83e606fecb1c"], "node": "e98cdedc4ba38eb7539595157cdd9c9cedac44fa", "parents": ["b8c732299cd65d8dc3695147b591dc8abb997b06"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790368949, "git_changesets": ["0bfb786fafd5393bef567e55f61c77340cd54481"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "699": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nicolas Grunbaum \u003cngrunbaum@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068255 - do not use magic numbers & supporting changes;r=dbaker a=diannaS\n\nThis is a squashed rebased stack of the following commits:\n\nBug 2068255 - do not use magic numbers;r=dbaker\nBug 2071056 - make gecko-profiler optional for mdns_service;r=dbaker\nBug 2070751 - run clippy on mdns_service;r=dbaker\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329356\n", "files": ["dom/media/webrtc/transport/mdns_service/Cargo.toml", "dom/media/webrtc/transport/mdns_service/src/lib.rs", "toolkit/library/rust/shared/Cargo.toml"], "git_node": "6be51d385a26383f4b5f0fd21d694e81fd2beebb", "git_parents": ["0bfb786fafd5393bef567e55f61c77340cd54481"], "node": "479af82da442a0adea796b170db37399df3a5af4", "parents": ["e98cdedc4ba38eb7539595157cdd9c9cedac44fa"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790390315, "git_changesets": ["6be51d385a26383f4b5f0fd21d694e81fd2beebb"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "700": {"changesets": [{"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074107 - Properly support an identity color matrix with accelerated filters.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nWhen an identity color matrix is supplied, this may generate a filter sequence of premul-crop-unpremul\ninstead of the expected premul-crop-colormatrix-unpremul. This caused a fallback to a software filter\nthat failed to read back from an A8 accelerated textures.\n\nThis fixes the A8 readback to work and plumbs the necessary pathway through FilterNodeWebgl::Draw to\navoid the fallback.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328744\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329301\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/DrawTargetWebgl.cpp", "dom/canvas/FilterNodeWebgl.cpp", "dom/canvas/FilterNodeWebgl.h", "dom/canvas/test/reftest/2074107-1-ref.html", "dom/canvas/test/reftest/2074107-1.html", "dom/canvas/test/reftest/reftest.list"], "git_node": "aac5627c7c7557cae093d4271492ffc293459c07", "git_parents": ["6be51d385a26383f4b5f0fd21d694e81fd2beebb"], "node": "c847a64adee7327cba0ad0a90e719495d60357f0", "parents": ["479af82da442a0adea796b170db37399df3a5af4"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790557810, "git_changesets": ["aac5627c7c7557cae093d4271492ffc293459c07"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "701": {"changesets": [{"author": "Michael Kaply \u003cmozilla@kaply.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074406 - Preserve case when unwrapping about:reader URLs in WebsiteFilter.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328893\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329192\n", "files": ["browser/components/enterprisepolicies/helpers/WebsiteFilter.sys.mjs", "browser/components/enterprisepolicies/tests/browser/browser_policy_websitefilter.js"], "git_node": "7d9251322928a58024e7d32cb091cc874bfd908c", "git_parents": ["aac5627c7c7557cae093d4271492ffc293459c07"], "node": "06494afa7fb0114236344e61ffbd5e78fb75800a", "parents": ["c847a64adee7327cba0ad0a90e719495d60357f0"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790557833, "git_changesets": ["7d9251322928a58024e7d32cb091cc874bfd908c"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "702": {"changesets": [{"author": "David Shin \u003cdshin@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068441: Make browsing context under printing browsing context not targetable.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327854\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329197\n", "files": ["docshell/base/BrowsingContext.cpp", "dom/base/crashtests/2068441.html", "dom/base/crashtests/crashtests.list"], "git_node": "8a07757649b1e4c0fc62e4c42c449a5e531d4453", "git_parents": ["7d9251322928a58024e7d32cb091cc874bfd908c"], "node": "28eebedb2ebf47a668eff6f5b4e2d0d04a559c07", "parents": ["06494afa7fb0114236344e61ffbd5e78fb75800a"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790557870, "git_changesets": ["8a07757649b1e4c0fc62e4c42c449a5e531d4453"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "703": {"changesets": [{"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072448 - Fix PatternT::IsWeak() to compare against the correct type.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\ndecltype(*this) inside a const method is actually const Foo&, instead of just Foo.\nThis caused IsWeak to always return false. Fix it to use the correct comparison of\nis_same\u003cdecltype(this), const Weak*\u003e.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327559\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329505\n", "files": ["gfx/2d/2D.h"], "git_node": "9ffef638fdd59d5863c92de43f44d0cad280a425", "git_parents": ["8a07757649b1e4c0fc62e4c42c449a5e531d4453"], "node": "567e8120ab9d2dc8b930caab3370a92959f02864", "parents": ["28eebedb2ebf47a668eff6f5b4e2d0d04a559c07"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790557908, "git_changesets": ["9ffef638fdd59d5863c92de43f44d0cad280a425"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "704": {"changesets": [{"author": "mandysGit \u003cmcheang@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073145 - Remove Amazon from Remote Settings (search-config-v2 and search-config-overrides-v2).  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326989\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329350\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/search/tests/xpcshell/searchconfigs/test_searchconfig.js"], "git_node": "f4ff8ae0034bd665b9d181a748ac9e0406cf4f75", "git_parents": ["9ffef638fdd59d5863c92de43f44d0cad280a425"], "node": "f6045c0c026ff54841a699b889093c7a7fa7312f", "parents": ["567e8120ab9d2dc8b930caab3370a92959f02864"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790558511, "git_changesets": ["f4ff8ae0034bd665b9d181a748ac9e0406cf4f75"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "705": {"changesets": [{"author": "Marco Bonardo \u003cmbonardo@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075533.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329139\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329149\n", "files": ["xpcom/io/nsLocalFileUnix.cpp", "xpcom/io/nsLocalFileWin.cpp"], "git_node": "dd0b4788ed7a352d01a00e4fe657e83f78cbe977", "git_parents": ["f4ff8ae0034bd665b9d181a748ac9e0406cf4f75"], "node": "3e099344761fb602a0bc685a8f9cbf48d7aea154", "parents": ["f6045c0c026ff54841a699b889093c7a7fa7312f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790597194, "git_changesets": ["dd0b4788ed7a352d01a00e4fe657e83f78cbe977"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "706": {"changesets": [{"author": "Gabriele Svelto \u003cgsvelto@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068421 - Make crash helper message reception more robust on Windows  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326105\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329189\n", "files": ["toolkit/crashreporter/crash_helper_common/src/ipc_queue.rs", "toolkit/crashreporter/crash_helper_common/src/ipc_queue/windows.rs", "toolkit/crashreporter/crash_helper_common/src/platform/windows.rs"], "git_node": "1de16c67144dd8a95213ff5912686f7e6beab38f", "git_parents": ["dd0b4788ed7a352d01a00e4fe657e83f78cbe977"], "node": "f748bbf1543e359f662d2edfa4a9c5a30d6c855d", "parents": ["3e099344761fb602a0bc685a8f9cbf48d7aea154"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790597327, "git_changesets": ["1de16c67144dd8a95213ff5912686f7e6beab38f"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "707": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jari Jalkanen \u003cjjalkanen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059211: Cap streaming request body sizes. r=valentin a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325120\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329258\n", "files": ["netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpTransaction.cpp"], "git_node": "951a55de152953c09a8963649371c6cf2e28c1d9", "git_parents": ["1de16c67144dd8a95213ff5912686f7e6beab38f"], "node": "bb77a94cd004abce6ece91fbb6cbc185c81b3550", "parents": ["f748bbf1543e359f662d2edfa4a9c5a30d6c855d"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790597436, "git_changesets": ["951a55de152953c09a8963649371c6cf2e28c1d9"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "708": {"changesets": [{"author": "Florian Qu\u00e8ze \u003cflorian@queze.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1970802 - Wait for the new tab to be reflowed in openNewForegroundTab, .  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nA remote browser has a 0x0 viewport until we reflow it and send\nUpdateDimensions, so a caller that synthesizes input as soon as\nopenNewForegroundTab resolves can hit test against an empty area, and the event\nresolves to the document rather than to an element.\n\nThe wait runs alongside the load, so it only costs anything when nothing else\nalready waited for a tick.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D322870\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329577\n", "files": ["testing/mochitest/BrowserTestUtils/BrowserTestUtils.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "69c80da4339b1c94b7d2e7a5daa5050355171347", "git_parents": ["951a55de152953c09a8963649371c6cf2e28c1d9"], "node": "855d8ec9c2ba24c4d9622dbbc9be7b7695c8e0b4", "parents": ["bb77a94cd004abce6ece91fbb6cbc185c81b3550"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790597657, "git_changesets": ["69c80da4339b1c94b7d2e7a5daa5050355171347"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "709": {"changesets": [{"author": "longsonr \u003clongsonr@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074896 - Prevent feTile rect calculations from overflowing  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328561\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329483\n", "files": ["gfx/2d/FilterNodeSoftware.cpp", "gfx/tests/gtest/TestFilterNodeSoftware.cpp", "gfx/tests/gtest/moz.build"], "git_node": "dd674cf87236c68f1be17b6d1259a3a1be7cd2dd", "git_parents": ["69c80da4339b1c94b7d2e7a5daa5050355171347"], "node": "0a63a778da04c80adfe00aa9a4ba5af155c9955f", "parents": ["855d8ec9c2ba24c4d9622dbbc9be7b7695c8e0b4"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790600062, "git_changesets": ["dd674cf87236c68f1be17b6d1259a3a1be7cd2dd"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "710": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr153 repo-update remote-settings tld-suffixes ct-logs -  a=dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329542\n", "files": ["netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/ct/CTKnownLogs.h", "security/manager/tools/log_list.json", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/main/devtools-compatibility-browsers.json", "services/settings/dumps/main/search-telemetry-v2.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json", "toolkit/components/certviewer/content/components/logNameTable.mjs"], "git_node": "7afe8b4d28ba69148a60ddf1d8ba8cd7058c9046", "git_parents": ["dd674cf87236c68f1be17b6d1259a3a1be7cd2dd"], "node": "c45853c50f312cb424cf270fc7207937e0ca0c12", "parents": ["0a63a778da04c80adfe00aa9a4ba5af155c9955f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790600247, "git_changesets": ["7afe8b4d28ba69148a60ddf1d8ba8cd7058c9046"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "711": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "tags-unified", "desc": "No bug - Tagging 1d349a6de68c5b3e8e0db2493d871eef1926d837 with FIREFOX-ANDROID_157_0b5_BUILD1 a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "fil